    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly though, the \"finding a way forward\" part feels so hollow. how can you move forward when the foundation is gone? it's like the engine of my life just... stopped. i'm just occupying space. it's exhausting to pretend there's a \"me\" left to save when the only thing left is this injury and a memory of who i used to be.",
