      "content": "but what if there is nothing left to rebuild? it feels like you're talking about fixing a car that's been completely melted down. the essence of who i was—the grace, the strength, the way i moved through the world—that's gone. i'm just stuck with this heavy, broken physical body that serves no purpose anymore. doesn't it seem almost cruel to force someone to keep going when the soul of who they were has already been extinguished?",
